=========================================================================================================
VALIDATION / INTERPRETATION
=========================================================================================================
- Hourly profile is normalized within operator.
- Activity index = 100 represents each operator's mean hourly activity.
- AM and PM transport peaks are predefined transport-analysis periods.
- AM peak = 07:00-09:59.
- PM peak = 16:00-19:59.
- Empirical system peak hours are 15:00-20:59.
- Empirical peak boundaries are visually separated from conventional peak shading.
- Heatmap uses absolute pooled system activity.
- Heatmap values are average trips per weekday-hour occurrence.
- Heatmap rectangles identify observed weekday-specific maximum activity cells.
- Both figures use the common Feb-Dec 2024 detailed-time window.
- VOI January 2024 is excluded because detailed timestamps are unavailable.
- No behavioural trip-purpose interpretation is imposed by these figures.

